      "ingredients": "For the Banana Pudding Base:\n¾ cup ripe banana, sliced\n½ cup milk\n2 tbsps. sweetened condensed milk \n¼ tsp. vanilla extract\nFor the Matcha:\n1 tsp. The Superfood Grocer Premium Ceremonial Grade Matcha Powder\n¼ cup hot water \nFor Assembly & Garnish:\n1 cup ice cubes\n⅓ cup whipped cream",
